{"kind":"cas-record-v1","metadata":{"entries":[{"origin_package":"github.com/codalotl/codalotl/internal/tools/coretools","target_package":"github.com/codalotl/codalotl/internal/applypatch","identifier":"ApplyPatch","question":"For an update with `*** Move to:`, which FileChange entries and paths are returned: only the destination, or both source and destination? I need to detect whether any changed path has a .go extension, including renames.","answer":"`ApplyPatch` returns both paths for an update containing `*** Move to:`:\n\n- Source: `FileChange{Path: oldPath, Kind: FileChangeDeleted}`\n- Destination: `FileChange{Path: newPath, Kind: FileChangeAdded}`\n\nThey appear consecutively in that order. Paths are slash-separated and relative to `cwdAbsPath`.\n\nTo detect Go files, inspect every returned entry:\n\n```go\nchanges, err := applypatch.ApplyPatch(root, patch)\nif err != nil {\n\treturn err\n}\n\nhasGoChange := false\nfor _, change := range changes {\n\tif filepath.Ext(change.Path) == \".go\" {\n\t\thasGoChange = true\n\t\tbreak\n\t}\n}\n```\n\nThis detects renames both from `.go` to another extension and from another extension to `.go`.\n\nIf detection is needed before applying the patch, `AffectedPaths` also includes both source and destination, but returns unique absolute paths."},{"origin_package":"github.com/codalotl/codalotl/internal/tools/coretools","target_package":"github.com/codalotl/codalotl/internal/applypatch","identifier":"FileChange","question":"For an update with `*** Move to:`, which paths are returned in []FileChange: the old source path, new destination path, or both, and with which kinds?","answer":"For an update with `*** Move to:`, `ApplyPatch` returns two `FileChange` entries, in this order:\n\n- Old source path: `FileChangeDeleted`\n- New destination path: `FileChangeAdded`\n\nBoth paths are slash-separated and relative to the `cwdAbsPath` root. It does not return `FileChangeModified` for a moved update, even when the file content is also changed."}]},"additional_info":{"unix_timestamp":1784226217,"paths":["internal/applypatch/SPEC.md","internal/applypatch/affected_paths_test.go","internal/applypatch/apply_patch.go","internal/applypatch/apply_patch_codex_diff_test.go","internal/applypatch/apply_patch_codex_test.go","internal/applypatch/apply_patch_test.go","internal/applypatch/is_invalid_patch_test.go","internal/applypatch/preparation_test.go","internal/applypatch/replace.go","internal/applypatch/replace_test.go"],"git_clean":false,"git_commit":"a0933989e14357039beb63fc7cab8c6d729bfe70","git_merge_base":"4bc7dae434de30b02c38e42feb254065d3020f3f"}}